  "limitations": [
    "P02 integrated native evidence: the C04, C05, C06 and C07 drivers ran against the single P02-prepared fixture bundle with AIRS_NATIVE_SUBJECT=P02 (native-<chunk>/, native-acceptance-<chunk>.json), merged by tools/native-acceptance/merge_phase.py into native-acceptance.json; the C05 learner-sync workload (C04 registration) was re-measured on that bundle (workload-perf.json).",
